3f:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Completely. His commentaries are still the primary texts studied in Sanskrit philosophy courses. His analysis of consciousness, identity, and liberation reads as incisively as ever. Figures like Ramana Maharshi and Swami Vivekananda worked directly within his framework."}]
